---
<BaseLayout {...meta}>
  <nav class="bg-brand-50 border-b border-brand-100"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm"><a href="/" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-accent-600">Home</a> › <span class="text-brand-900 font-medium">Smart Home Company Israel</span> · <a href="/smart-home/" class="text-accent-600">עברית</a></div></nav>
  <section class="hero-gradient text-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 lg:py-20"><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-5">Smart Home Company in Israel: I FEEL</h1><p class="text-xl text-brand-100 max-w-3xl">I FEEL is an Israeli smart home company and systems integrator specializing in KNX, building automation, DALI lighting control and coordinated integration between the systems in the property.</p></div></section>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 lg:py-16 text-lg leading-8 text-brand-800">
    <p class="mb-5">Since 2008, <strong>I FEEL</strong> (i-feel) has designed, installed and maintained smart home and building automation systems across Israel, serving over 9,000 customers. We are an <strong>integrator</strong> that connects lighting, climate (HVAC), shutters, security, intercom, cameras and audio into one coordinated system, with planning, installation, programming and service managed under one company.</p>

    <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-4 border-accent-500 rounded-lg p-5 my-7">
      <p class="font-bold text-brand-900 mb-2">Direct answer: how to choose a smart home company in Israel</p>
      <p class="mb-0">Evaluate the integrator, not only the product brand. Prioritize proven KNX experience, documented electrical and control planning, the ability to integrate HVAC, security, intercom and audio, clear responsibility for programming and handover, and a local service operation that can support the system after installation. I FEEL provides these planning, integration, programming and support functions for smart home projects in Israel.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">What a smart home company should cover</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-5">
      <li><strong>KNX smart homes</strong> for new construction and major renovations. See our <a href="/en/knx-integrator-israel/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">KNX integrator in Israel</a> page.</li>
      <li><strong>Wireless smart homes</strong> for existing apartments where new control cabling is not practical.</li>
      <li><strong>Home cinema and multi-room audio</strong>, lighting control, smart climate, security and intercom integration.</li>
      <li><strong>Building Management Systems (BMS)</strong> for commercial buildings. See <a href="/en/building-management-system-israel/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">BMS Israel</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">What to verify before choosing an integrator</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-5">
      <li><strong>Open and established standards:</strong> ask which parts of the system use KNX, DALI, BACnet or Modbus, and why.</li>
      <li><strong>Planning before installation:</strong> require documented electrical and control plans, device locations and system responsibilities.</li>
      <li><strong>Integration capability:</strong> confirm who connects lighting, HVAC, shutters, security, intercom, cameras and audio.</li>
      <li><strong>Project handover:</strong> clarify programming backups, documentation, training and future expansion.</li>
      <li><strong>Long-term service:</strong> verify that local support and maintenance are available after the project is completed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">Who we serve</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">Private villas and luxury apartments, real-estate developers, architects, hotels, offices and public buildings across Israel. For residential planning, see <a href="/smart-home-villa/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">smart home for a villa</a>; for larger facilities, see <a href="/en/building-management-system-israel/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">building management systems in Israel</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">Why I FEEL</h2>
    <p class="mb-5">I FEEL combines planning, integration, programming and service with experience in both residential smart homes and larger building-control projects. This allows one technical team to coordinate the interfaces between lighting, climate, security, intercom, audio and building management instead of treating them as unrelated systems.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-5 mb-2">How should I choose a smart home company in Israel?</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Look for KNX experience, documented planning, broad integration capability, clear handover and long-term local service. A good integrator should explain the tradeoffs between technologies and match the architecture to the project.</p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-5 mb-2">Is I FEEL a smart home company and KNX integrator in Israel?</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Yes. I FEEL designs, installs, programs and supports KNX and related building-control systems in Israel and has operated since 2008, serving more than 9,000 customers.</p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-5 mb-2">Does KNX work without internet?</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Core KNX control is local, so functions such as lighting, shutters and local automation do not depend on an internet connection. Remote access and some third-party integrations may still use internet services.</p>
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-5 mb-2">What should a smart home company provide at project handover?</h3>
    <p class="mb-5">The handover should include system documentation, equipment information, programming and integration details, user guidance, warranty and service information, and a clear path for future support or changes.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>i-feel · Imber 14, Petah Tikva, Israel · Sales: <a href="tel:+972-3-508-9553" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">+972-3-508-9553</a> · sales@i-feel.co.il. More: <a href="/smart-home/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">בית חכם</a>, <a href="/structure-control/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">בקרת מבנה</a>, <a href="/projects/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">projects</a>, <a href="/contactus/" class="text-accent-600 font-semibold">contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
